Description: D-Bus inspection and debugging tool
 Sonde is a graphical D-Bus observer.  It browses services, object
 paths, interfaces, methods, signals and properties; reads and writes
 properties; calls methods with signature-driven argument forms; and
 shows the live message stream with field-based filtering.
